flowchart TD
    A[Receive booking command] --> B[Authenticate and authorize tenant action]
    B --> C[Claim idempotency key and compare request hash]
    C -->|Existing result| R[Replay original result]
    C -->|New command| D[Begin short transaction]
    D --> E[Lock booking or draft aggregate]
    E --> F[Lock resources or capacity buckets in stable order]
    F --> G{Capacity still available?}
    G -->|No| H[Record deterministic rejection]
    G -->|Yes| I[Create or convert authoritative reservations]
    I --> J[Write snapshot, schedule and transition]
    J --> K[Append outbox and terminal idempotency result]
    H --> K
    K --> L[Commit once]
    L --> M[Workers call providers after commit]
    M --> N[Inbox and idempotency prevent duplicate effects]
